# Compiled binary. `make build` installs into ~/.local/bin, but a bare
# `go build ./cmd/pager` drops it here.
/pager
*.exe

# Agent planning state: per-task plans, worktree reservations, session notes.
# Local working material, and it names other projects and people — it must not
# reach the repo. Only a global excludesfile protected this until now, so a
# clone on another machine would have staged it with `git add -A`.
.agents/

# The message store and its WAL sidecars. The real one lives at ~/.pager/msg.db;
# these patterns catch the temporary stores tests and `PAGER_DB` runs leave behind.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# OS / editor noise.
.DS_Store
